# Architecture & Structure

## CLIENT: File Structure

```
src/
├── components/      # Reusable UI components
│   ├── modals/      # Modal components
│   ├── panels/      # Panel components (main UI sections)
│   ├── popup/       # Popup overlays
│   └── selector/    # Picker/selector components
├── screens/         # Screen-level components (routes)
├── ui/
│   ├── components/  # Base UI components (Card, Input, Pickers)
│   └── tokens/      # Design tokens (NEVER modify without approval)
├── services/        # API service layer (axios)
├── hooks/          # Custom React hooks
├── contexts/       # React Context providers
├── types/          # TypeScript type definitions
├── utils/          # Utility functions
└── constants/      # Constants and static data
```

## SERVER: Module Structure

**Every feature module MUST follow this structure:**

```
{feature}/
├── __init__.py
├── router.py        # FastAPI endpoints (HTTP layer)
├── service.py       # Business logic (validation, authorization)
├── repository.py    # Database queries (data access)
├── schemas.py       # Pydantic schemas (request/response)
└── models.py        # SQLAlchemy models (optional, if not in root)
```

**✅ ALWAYS follow layered architecture:**

```
Router → Service → Repository → Database
  ↓         ↓          ↓
 HTTP    Business   Data
 Layer   Logic      Access
```
